00:03:43.272 --> 00:03:44.318
and then there's the authentic way.

00:03:44.318 --> 00:03:48.235
The authentic way is it
naturally gets its own steam,

00:03:48.235 --> 00:03:51.715
one person passes on,
recommends it and away it goes.

00:03:51.715 --> 00:03:56.715
You can market that by over
investing in influencers

00:03:56.759 --> 00:03:59.005
and paying them to post.

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.800
There's a level of transaction

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.714
that eliminates the
authenticity of that shout-out.

00:04:03.714 --> 00:04:06.879
My belief is that the number
one way to really get books out

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:10.098
is through access and
what I mean by that is,

00:04:10.098 --> 00:04:12.677
