00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.521
and then you have to give
away those 15 copies,

00:04:27.521 --> 00:04:29.394
to friends and family.

00:04:29.394 --> 00:04:30.530
Now, what you're doing is,

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:32.575
you're taking your people
that actually care,

00:04:32.575 --> 00:04:34.225
that actually value you,

00:04:34.225 --> 00:04:37.556
and you're making them part
of the overall team, right,

00:04:37.556 --> 00:04:40.344
and you're spreading it
with a more authentic way.

00:04:40.344 --> 00:04:43.167
I think that influencer
marketing is one of the best,

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:44.678
you know, ways to market.

00:04:44.678 --> 00:04:48.427
However, people are too
ideological about it.

00:04:48.427 --> 00:04:52.344
Like, you know, you're
gonna need to either pay

00:04:53.746 --> 00:04:56.671
