00:05:12.587 --> 00:05:14.630
and then you're hoping

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:17.301
that they actually share it.

00:05:17.301 --> 00:05:18.770
- But it's hard because,

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.591
I think the hardest part right now is that

00:05:20.591 --> 00:05:23.065
because we're in a
pandemic and we're home,

00:05:23.065 --> 00:05:24.783
people are not at their offices.

00:05:24.783 --> 00:05:27.150
If you ask influencers for their address,

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:28.562
they don't wanna give
you their home address,

00:05:28.562 --> 00:05:31.397
they just wanna give you their office,

00:05:31.397 --> 00:05:32.770
yeah, and they're not there,

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.129
so, I've been sending it to.

00:05:35.129 --> 00:05:36.723
- I think that's an excuse,

00:05:36.723 --> 00:05:40.359
like influencers are
getting unlimited products

00:05:40.359 --> 00:05:43.798
sent to their P.O boxes and
offices and having it delivered.

00:05:43.798 --> 00:05:45.661
I think that if you called and said,

00:05:45.661 --> 00:05:48.247
"I've got $5,000 for you, where
