00:05:49.913 --> 00:05:54.047
Miraculously, their office
is gonna be fucking open.

00:05:54.047 --> 00:05:55.579
I think that's an excuse that,

00:05:55.579 --> 00:05:58.390
you're making that excuse and
they're making that excuse,

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:01.975
because most people don't want to,

00:06:01.975 --> 00:06:04.900
post about things without
naturally feeling it

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.644
or being compensated for it.

00:06:06.644 --> 00:06:09.229
So, I also think it comes down to

00:06:09.229 --> 00:06:12.759
how many influencers have
you asked or reached out to.

00:06:12.759 --> 00:06:13.606
