For example, if they don't use Instagram,

00:06:18.293 --> 00:06:20.917
like so many influencers
are very active and I,

00:06:20.917 --> 00:06:22.984
and you know they would look at their DMs,

00:06:22.984 --> 00:06:24.996
but some, for example, Brene Brown,

00:06:24.996 --> 00:06:27.566
she's not really on Instagram,

00:06:27.566 --> 00:06:32.495
so, she's really hard to get
in that way, is there any?

00:06:32.495 --> 00:06:33.558
- I mean, look,

00:06:33.558 --> 00:06:36.288
here's where audacity takes over, right,

00:06:36.288 --> 00:06:37.893
where you need to be careful.

00:06:37.893 --> 00:06:40.789
You know, if you want Brene
Brown to shout-out your book,

00:06:40.789 --> 00:06:45.206
it shouldn't be as easy as,
"hey, shout-out my book."

00:06:46.489 --> 00:06:50.198
I think that you send her
a copy with a nice letter,

00:06:50.198 --> 00:06:51.881
to whatever address you can find,

00:06:51.881 --> 00:06:56.881
that the letter is your only
prayer of getting her to do it.

00:06:57.796 --> 00:07:00.286
Or you DM her or you
hit her up on LinkedIn,

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:01.720
I mean, it's just asking,

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:04.627
but you have so little
leverage in that scenario.

00:07:04.627 --> 00:07:06.154
Literally, there's 40,000 people

00:07:06.154 --> 00:07:08.844
trying to get to Brene
Brown on a daily basis,

00:07:08.844 --> 00:07:11.500
to promote their product for them,

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:14.014
with nothing in return for Brene.

00:07:14.014 --> 00:07:15.482
- Definitely, yes.
- And just

00:07:15.482 --> 00:07:17.348
even say the sentence.

00:07:17.348 --> 00:07:20.300
You know, like, "I would
like you to do this for me,

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.125
I have nothing to offer you,

00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:23.612
other than I believe this is good,"

00:07:23.612 --> 00:07:25.720
but everybody thinks
their baby is the cutest.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.389
Everybody thinks their book is the best.

00:07:27.389 --> 00:07:29.676
Everybody thinks their makeup or course,

00:07:29.676 --> 00:07:30.885
or meditation thing,

00:07:30.885 --> 00:07:34.569
or you know, premium product,
everybody thinks that.

00:07:34.569 --> 00:07:35.922
- I know, I know, but I,

00:07:35.922 --> 00:07:38.175
well, for me, I've seen the success

00:07:38.175 --> 00:07:39.984
because of my speaking career.

00:07:39.984 --> 00:07:41.628
- Of course, people have seen the success

00:07:41.628 --> 00:07:44.120
on everything that they put out.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:47.146
Whether you're right or wrong,

00:07:47.146 --> 00:07:49.763
the relationship between getting somebody

00:07:49.763 --> 00:07:51.999
to give you something of value,

00:07:51.999 --> 00:07:54.708
with nothing in return for them,

00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:56.390
comes out of a couple places.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:08:00.008
You've earned it by creating
a relationship with them

00:08:00.008 --> 00:08:02.194
for a long period of time,

00:08:02.194 --> 00:08:05.127
you got lucky out of the
goodness of their heart

00:08:05.127 --> 00:08:08.024
and they're doing something nice for you

00:08:08.024 --> 00:08:09.743
