It" and they love it,

00:10:04.038 --> 00:10:06.028
I wrote that book 12 years ago.

00:10:06.028 --> 00:10:07.793
- Yeah, I love that book (laughs).

00:10:07.793 --> 00:10:09.183
Well, thank you so much for writing it.

00:10:09.183 --> 00:10:10.333
- You're welcome, you're welcome.

00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:14.475
Look, I think that you need
to really think about it,

00:10:14.475 --> 00:10:17.308
what's in it for the other person?

00:10:18.664 --> 00:10:19.940
- Yeah, yeah.
- That's the key.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:20.773
- Mm hmm.

00:10:20.773 --> 00:10:24.119
- You know, what's in
it for the other person?

00:10:24.119 --> 00:10:25.710
Not what's in it for you.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.484
Because when people come
from what's in it for them,

00:10:28.484 --> 00:10:30.620
they tend to fall short of
what they're looking for.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.710
- Mm hmm, and I'm not even,
honestly, looking for me,

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:34.863
even though, of course,

00:10:34.863 --> 00:10:36.618
this can take my career to the next level,

00:10:36.618 --> 00:10:40.777
but I just know so many people
should be reading this book,

00:10:40.777 --> 00:10:43.356
mostly now, it's about facing your fears

00:10:43.356 --> 00:10:46.096
and becoming who you're
meant to be and it's,

00:10:46.096 --> 00:10:49.751
this is the right time
to be talking about fear.

00:10:49.751 --> 00:10:52.475
- You need to be reaching
out to every podcast

00:10:52.475 --> 00:10:54.308
every platform you can

00:10:55.581 --> 00:10:57.416
and getting out there
and talking about it,

00:10:57.416 --> 00:11:01.561
whether that is a podcast
that has 200 listeners

00:11:01.561 --> 00:11:03.626
or whether it has 3000 listeners,

00:11:03.626 --> 00:11:07.418
you need to be in constant
motion, constant promotion

00:11:07.418 --> 00:11:08.772
and figure it out.

00:11:08.772 --> 00:11:10.373
